// Self-centered ground burst, same Explosion shape as thunderclap.ron.
// Explosion always hardcodes DamageKind::Crushing -- for this spell that
// is an exact match, not a drift: the real damage type is Bludgeoning
// (Crushing's own content-name alias, per common/src/combat.rs's
// `#[serde(alias = "Bludgeoning")]`), so no mismatch note is needed here.
// The "loose terrain becomes difficult ground" rider is dropped: no
// difficult-terrain-creation primitive exists on this variant
// (destroy_terrain/replace_terrain only remove or reskin terrain, they
// don't apply a movement-speed debuff zone).
//
// Damage is set below this batch's single-target level-1 baseline (~20,
// see chaos_bolt.ron/hellish_rebuke.ron/spellfire_flare.ron) since this can
// hit multiple foes in the burst radius at once -- matching real D&D's own
// Earth Tremor (2d6, notably below a single-target 1st-level spell like
// Chromatic Orb's 3d8).
Explosion(
    energy_cost: 30,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    action_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    damage: 12,
    poise: 10,
    knockback: (direction: Away, strength: 5.0),
    radius: 3.0,
    min_falloff: 0.3,
    dodgeable: Roll,
    destroy_terrain: None,
    eye_height: false,
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
